{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object visible, approach and pick up, then check validity, process and finish. Else, scan or move. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Action ID = MoveToRandomLocation    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectValid    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    />\"",
